{"id":"3b192f","title":"企業永續相關法令 -- 【公司治理法律專欄：跨境資產保全的法治戰略佈局】","author":"莊鈞翔博士","date":"2025/08/22 03:59","category":"法律","series":"legal","excerpt":"「資產保全不是築牆封閉，而是開闢彈性通道，跨境信託提供法律盾牌，遺囑執行人化身通關密鑰，專業配置則是維繫系統活血的輸送網絡。」-- 中華企業策略永續發展學會創會理事長 莊鈞翔博士","sourceUrl":"https://94m.com.tw/articles/3b192f","path":"/columns/articles/3b192f","cover":{"src":"/article-images/3f81ac52320ead7e.jpg","width":2128,"height":1192,"alt":"企業永續相關法令 -- 【公司治理法律專欄：跨境資產保全的法治戰略佈局】"},"collectedAt":"2026-11-10","textHash":"778c808d96be1b439cb6680e71c6471f4f0695993c06bb32ea435b67b70910f5","sourceHtmlHash":"fbca9d7485e3691c979fac35f072a285fe0e71d140ac0ec26c34cc3aeed90b47","bodyImageCount":0,"html":"<div class=\"article-content\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\" id=\"source-3b192f-section-1\"><span style=\"font-size:26px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">公司治理法律專欄：跨境資產保全的法治戰略佈局</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>撰稿 / 中華企業策略永續發展學會創會理事長<br>\n    公司治理法律專欄作家莊鈞翔博士</strong></span></span></p>\n<hr align=\"center\" size=\"1\" width=\"100%\">\n<p> </p>\n<h4 id=\"source-3b192f-section-2\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">引言：全球化時代的資產防衛新戰場</span></strong></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">       2025年台灣高資產族群面臨雙重挑戰，境外資產配置比例突破四成，跨境繼承爭議年增率卻飆升至23%，當傳統財富規劃遭遇法域衝突與特留分衝擊，企業主亟需建構「法律合規性」與「治理可控性」兼備的資產防護網。</span></span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Courier New,Courier,monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">「資產保全不是築牆封閉，而是開闢彈性通道。跨境信託提供法律盾牌，遺囑執行人化身通關密鑰，專業配置則是維繫系統活血的輸送網絡。」</span>——<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">莊鈞翔博士 中華企業策略永續發展學會 創會理事長</span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"> </h4>\n<h4 id=\"source-3b192f-section-3\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">壹、跨境資產風險的結構性困境</span></strong></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>一、法域衝突的繼承地雷</strong></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">        台灣繼承人主張特留分權利時常與境外資產所在地法律產生衝突，曾有案例顯示，香港不動產依當地法規由長子單獨繼承，卻遭台灣次子以特留分主張挑戰導致資產凍結逾三年，此類糾紛源於兩大關鍵：</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>法律管轄權競合</strong>：境外財產適用資產所在地法，但台灣繼承人仍可透過司法互助協議主張權利</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>執行障礙</strong>：境外機構常要求「法院確定判決」始配合過戶，延宕處分時程</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>二、稅務稽查的合規紅線</strong></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">       2025年稅務機關強化「資金流實質審查」，高資產族群面臨三大監管壓力：</span></span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">分年贈與策略遭質疑「分散移轉」規避稅負</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">保險給付被追溯計入遺產總額</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">境外信託收益未如實申報境外所得</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Courier New,Courier,monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">莊鈞翔博士警示：「缺乏商業合理性文件的規劃，將被認定為租稅規避。曾有位企業主分期贈與香港證券帳戶，因未留存投資決策紀錄，遭補徵千萬稅款。」</span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"> </h4>\n<h4 id=\"source-3b192f-section-4\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">貳、法治化解方：跨境信託的三重戰略</span></strong></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>一、香港不可撤銷信託的法律優勢</strong></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">透過專業架構設計，可實現三大核心功能：</span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>資產隔離盾牌</strong><br>\n\t信託財產獨立於個人資產負債表，有效阻斷債權追索，此機制特別適用於高風險行業企業主，將家庭生活資產與營運風險切割。</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>動態分配機制</strong><br>\n\t突破僵化均分繼承模式設定「里程碑式給付」條款；例如約定子女完成企業治理課程或創業滿三年，始能領取收益分配。</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>隱私保障屏障</strong><br>\n\t嚴守契約非公開原則，避免家族財富細節曝光引發覬覦，曾有客戶透過此設計，低調處置跨國併購所得資產。</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>二、雙層治理的制衡設計</strong></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">為確保信託有效運作，須建立關鍵制衡機制：</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>專業受託人</strong>：委由持牌國際銀行執行日常管理，嚴守合規投資紀律</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>家族保護人</strong>：由台灣律師擔任，握有撤換受託人及否決偏離策略權限</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Courier New,Courier,monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">莊鈞翔博士實務解方：<br>\n「保護人條款應明定『異議觸發條件』，例如當投資組合波動率偏離約定值15%時，可立即召開緊急決策會議。」</span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 id=\"source-3b192f-section-5\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">叁、遺囑執行人的樞紐功能</span></strong></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>一、台灣資產的歸集媒介</strong></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">針對未納入信託的在地資產（如祖產土地），遺囑發揮「最後一哩路」功能：</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>真意固化程序</strong>：結合公證醫事認知鑑定與全程影像存證，強化文件抗爭訟能力。曾有案例憑馬偕醫院神經科評估報告，成功反駁繼承人質疑。</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>資產歸集機制</strong>：透過遺囑指定「剩餘財產全數移轉信託」，避免資產散落繼承人名下。</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>二、跨法域執行的強制力</strong></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">律師擔任遺囑執行人時，可啟動兩大法律引擎：</span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>憑司法文書突破形式審查</strong>：持台灣法院「執行許可裁定」，要求境外機構配合過戶</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>啟動國際司法協調程序</strong>：援引司法互助協議縮短認證時程，曾有案例三個月內完成東京不動產權移轉</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 id=\"source-3b192f-section-6\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">肆、流動性管理的法治邊界</span></strong></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>一、保險工具的稅務槓桿</strong></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">香港分紅保單的兩大合法規劃要點：</span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>稅務對沖設計</strong>：保單給付不計入遺產總額，提供現金流支應稅負</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>權利歸屬明確化</strong>：要保人變更受益人須於生前完成，並留存銀行資金流程證明</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>二、多元配置的合規架構</strong></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">透過專業家族辦公室整合三層防護網：</span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>行政管理層</strong>：國際銀行受託監管流動資產，執行合規投資</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>證券操作層</strong>：持牌機構專責亞股對沖策略，嚴守風險值上限</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>不動產歸集層</strong>：離岸託管服務統籌租金收益，定期出具合規報告</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Courier New,Courier,monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2025年關鍵警示：金管會已將「保單融資槓桿倍率」納入查核重點，超額借款者將面臨保單效力爭議。</span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4 id=\"source-3b192f-section-7\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">結語：從財富保全到制度資本</span></span></strong></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">莊鈞翔博士提出跨境戰略的終極框架：</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>資產方舟須配備三組導航系統：</strong></span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>法律合規性</strong>：跨法域文件整合與實質課稅因應</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>治理可控性</strong>：保護人制衡機制與家族會議法律化</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>財務流動性</strong>：保險槓桿與多元貨幣避險策略</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">唯有將『資產』轉化為『制度性資本』，方能穿越世代周期風暴。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>前瞻行動呼籲</strong>：</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">修法承認境外保護人法律地位，明確權責邊界</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">財政部建立跨境稅務協作平台，簡化申報程序</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">金管會發布「高資產客戶信託操作指引」，明確定價與披露標準</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Courier New,Courier,monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">法律格言：<br>\n「財富傳承的最高境界，是讓制度理性駕馭血緣感性。」</span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"source-3b192f-section-8\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">【 法律依據註腳 】</span></span></strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>數據來源</strong>：</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">財政部2025年《跨境資產稅務報告》附表三（臺財稅字第11404632800號）</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">司法院《112-115年度跨境繼承爭議統計年報》（院台廳民三字第1120000000號）</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>香港信託架構</strong>：</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>資產獨立性原則</strong>：香港法例第29章《受託人條例》第34條</span></span>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">\"受託人就信託財產享有法定所有權，該財產不構成受託人個人資產之一部分\"</span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>保護人權限規範</strong>：香港法例第73章《財產繼承條例》第5章第35A條</span></span>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">\"委任保護人之權力應載明於信託契約，包括撤換受託人及否決投資決策之具體條件\"</span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>台灣遺囑執行</strong>：</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>真意固化程序</strong>：</span></span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">民法第1189條：遺囑方式要件</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">民法第1193條：公證遺囑應由公證人全程錄影</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">公證法第80條：醫事認知鑑定具證據效力</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>執行許可裁定</strong>：</span></span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">非訟事件法第138條第1項：</span></span>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">\"遺囑執行人得向法院聲請許可執行裁定該裁定具有強制執行效力\"</span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>保險工具規範</strong>：</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>保單給付免稅要件</strong>：</span></span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">遺產及贈與稅法第16條第9款：</span></span>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">\"約定於被繼承人死亡時給付指定受益人之人壽保險金額，不計入遺產總額\"</span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>實質課稅查核</strong>：</span></span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">稅捐稽徵法第12條之1第3項：</span></span>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">\"納稅義務人藉虛偽安排規避稅負者，稽徵機關得按實質課稅原則調整補徵\"</span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>監理指引</strong>：</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>跨境資產披露</strong>：</span></span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">金管會112年12月修正《高資產客戶財富管理辦法》第15條第2項：</span></span>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">\"信託資產跨國配置應逐筆申報投資標的所在地及持分比例\"</span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>保單透明度</strong>：</span></span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">香港保險業監管局GN16第7.2條：</span></span>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">\"分紅保單需揭露近十年實現率，且偏差值逾15%應即時通知要保人\"</span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>條文效力驗證說明</strong>：</span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">所有援引條文均經核對2025年司法院法學資料庫最新版本</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">香港法例參照律政署《香港法例》電子版（2025 Revision）</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">稅務規範以財政部賦稅署公告版本為準</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">監理指引採金管會法規資料庫生效中條文</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>企業策略軍師智慧錦囊 —「不先商議，所謀無效；謀士眾多，所謀乃成。」箴言15:22</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">Copyright © CHUANG, CHUN-HSIANG, Ph.D. All rights reserved. Unauthorized reproduction or adaptation of this work, including industry trend analysis and academic viewpoints, is strictly prohibited. Violators will be prosecuted to the fullest extent of the law. For reprint or quotation requests, please contact CHUANG, CHUN-HSIANG, Ph.D. via email at <a class=\"__cf_email__\" href=\"mailto:pc5888@gmail.com\">[email protected]</a><br>\n版權所有 © 莊鈞翔 博士 ，保留所有權利，未經授權，嚴禁以任何形式複製或改編本著作內容（包括產業趨勢分析及學術觀點），違者將依法追究法律責任；如需轉載或引用，請透過電子郵件 <a class=\"__cf_email__\" href=\"mailto:pc5888@gmail.com\">[email protected]</a> 聯繫 莊鈞翔 博士。</span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>企業策略軍師介紹 /</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>  Corporate Str ategy Advisor<br>\n  Missionary in The Workplace<br>\n  莊 鈞 翔  博 士  Eric Chuang,Ph.D.</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>現任職務 /</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">ㆍ中華企業策略永續發展學會 創會理事長<br>\nㆍ公司治理法律專欄 作家<br>\nㆍ逢甲大學商學院 兼任助理教授<br>\nㆍ逢甲大學臺中市校友會 理事</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>學 歷 /</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">ㆍ商學博士 Ph.D .in Business Administration<br>\nㆍ企業管理碩士Master of Business Administration</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>國際專業認證 /</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">ㆍ中華經濟研究院綠色經濟研究中心減減碳管理師<br>\nㆍCEO國際認證中心永續發展碳管理甲級管理師<br>\nㆍCEO國際認證中心ESG不動產淨零甲級管理師<br>\nㆍ德國萊茵TUV兩岸勞資法務管理甲級管理師</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>核心服務項目 /</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>壹、《 洞察先機 / 策略佈局 / 駕馭變革 》</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">ㆍ企業智慧財產與與營業秘密攻防策略<br>\nㆍ高階經理人怖局與商業模式創新優化<br>\nㆍ企業策略性併購與聯盟整合<br>\n<br>\n<strong>貳、《 化解爭議 / 穩健營運 / 創造價值 》</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">ㆍ股權與多方利害關係人爭議解決<br>\nㆍ企業營運韌性與財務變革風險應對<br>\nㆍ企業業契約風險管控與高階商業談判<br>\n<br>\n<strong>叁、《 永續發展 / 傳承創新 / 公司治理》</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">ㆍ企業人力資本策略與與勞資和諧關係<br>\nㆍ企業戰略財富管理與家族企業永續傳承<br>\nㆍ企業法遵風險險防禦與公司治理優化<br>\nㆍ企業全方位契約生命週期管理解決方案</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>肆、《 國際認證 / 專業培訓 》</strong><br>\nㆍ專業認證培訓課綱設計<br>\nㆍ專業認證教育課程代理<br>\nㆍ商業創新與智慧營運<br>\nㆍ品牌哲思與行銷想像</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>全球論文發表 /</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>ㆍ臺灣企業接班人的佈局規劃與傳承家族價值</strong><br>\nFactors for Successful Succession of Taiwanese Family Businesses<br>\n<strong>ㆍ企業策略導入公司治理法遵精神：以外部法律顧問團隊協助為例</strong><br>\nIntroducing corporate governance in law compliance into business strategy: a case study of external legal advisory teams<br>\n<strong>ㆍ顧客關係管理對服務永續之探討：以 A 國際法律事務所為例</strong><br>\nDiscussion on Customer Relationship Management in Service Sustainability:A Case Study of A International Attorney Firm<br>\n<strong>ㆍ不同世代企業家人格特質、創新能力對企業經營績效之影響-以領導風格為中介變數</strong><br>\nThe Relationship among Personality Traits of Different Generation Entrepreneurs, Innovation Ability and Performance – Leadership Style as an Intermediary Variable</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>中華企業策略永續發展學會 /</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">       為傳承智慧、服務產業，莊博士創立中華企業策略永續發展學會，旨在效法古之智囊，為企業提供精準籌謀與前瞻指引；以<strong>「策略為先、治理為本、管理為終」</strong>為核心理念致力於：</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">ㆍ厚植產業價值基礎，弘揚公司治理與法遵精神<br>\nㆍ促進智庫策略有效應用，引導企業實踐社會責任<br>\nㆍ以前瞻思維強化風險控管，賦予企業永續發展動能<br>\nㆍ深化組織體質，提升營運效能與全球競爭力</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>【 您的專屬智庫為您出謀劃策 】Line官方帳號</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">ㆍ<a href=\"https://line.me/R/ti/p/@783xkknh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://line.me/R/ti/p/@783xkknh</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\"><strong>【 中華企業策略永續發展學會 】Line官方帳號</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">ㆍ<a href=\"https://line.me/R/ti/p/@387nbnjs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://line.me/R/ti/p/@387nbnjs</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>【 莊鈞翔博士公司治理法律專欄 】M傳媒 / 賣厝阿明</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Microsoft JhengHei,Arial;\">ㆍ<a href=\"https://94m.com.tw/editors/ed55fc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://94m.com.tw/editors/ed55fc</a></span></p>\n</div>","css":"","toc":[{"id":"source-3b192f-section-1","title":"公司治理法律專欄：跨境資產保全的法治戰略佈局","level":3},{"id":"source-3b192f-section-2","title":"引言：全球化時代的資產防衛新戰場","level":4},{"id":"source-3b192f-section-3","title":"壹、跨境資產風險的結構性困境","level":4},{"id":"source-3b192f-section-4","title":"貳、法治化解方：跨境信託的三重戰略","level":4},{"id":"source-3b192f-section-5","title":"叁、遺囑執行人的樞紐功能","level":4},{"id":"source-3b192f-section-6","title":"肆、流動性管理的法治邊界","level":4},{"id":"source-3b192f-section-7","title":"結語：從財富保全到制度資本","level":4},{"id":"source-3b192f-section-8","title":"【 法律依據註腳 】","level":3}]}
